# --- Build control: kernel WITHOUT hybridswap (isolate crash cause) ---
# Merged LAST so these override the =y from gki_defconfig.
# Disabling the root HYBRIDSWAP_ZRAM drops HYBRIDSWAP / SWAPD / CORE too
# (they depends on it) and stops compiling mm/oplus_mm sources.
# CONFIG_HYBRIDSWAP_ZRAM is not set
# CONFIG_HYBRIDSWAP is not set
# CONFIG_HYBRIDSWAP_SWAPD is not set
# CONFIG_HYBRIDSWAP_CORE is not set